The implementation mostly follows the revised design, but I’m seeing several issues that are real rather than cosmetic: a likely Rails streaming-body mismatch, output schemas that intentionally allow anything, and quote/history caching that still spends from the global Schwab budget twice. I’m checking the database model and cache behavior before writing the final review.
