The transport settings (`stateless: true`, `enable_json_response: true`, `serve_subscriptions_listen: false`) avoid most streaming bodies on the intended path. The controller is still brittle because it is treating a Rack app result as a Rails controller body; a future toggle or stateful path would hand Rails a `Proc` body that the controller response stack is not built to iterate.
